# 32. Local Setup

## Prerequisites

Recommended:

```text
Python 3.11+
Node.js 20+
Git
Modern browser
Webcam
```

A GPU is helpful for training but is not necessarily required for every stage.

---

## Clone

```bash
git clone <your-repository-url>
cd signflow-ai
```

---

## Python Environment

```bash
python -m venv .venv
```

### Windows

```bash
.venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Install backend and ML dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
```

---

## Run FastAPI

```bash
uvicorn backend.app.main:app --reload
```

---

## Run React

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

# 33. Example Backend Endpoints

