```text
GET /api/v1/health
```

Response:

```json
{
  "status": "ok",
  "service": "signflow-api"
}
```

## Live WebSocket

```text
WS /ws/v1/translate
```

Example prediction response:

```json
{
  "type": "prediction",
  "gloss": "ME NAME ARJUN",
  "english": "My name is Arjun.",
  "confidence": 0.91,
  "latency_ms": 87
}
```

Production schemas should be versioned and validated.

