# 34. Model Training Workflow

```text
Dataset
   ↓
Video preprocessing
   ↓
Landmark extraction
   ↓
Feature normalization
   ↓
Sequence generation
   ↓
Signer-aware split
   ↓
Training
   ↓
Validation
   ↓
Model selection
   ↓
Evaluation
   ↓
Checkpoint export
```

Example conceptual commands:

```bash
python ml/data/preprocess.py

python ml/features/landmarks.py

python ml/features/sequence.py

python ml/training/train.py --model bilstm

python ml/training/train.py --model transformer

python ml/training/evaluate.py
```

