# 35. 30-Day GitHub Development Plan

The project is intentionally organized so that **every day produces a meaningful GitHub commit**.

| Day | Deliverable | Suggested Commit |
|---:|---|---|
| 1 | Repository + project docs | `Day 01: Initialize SignFlow AI project` |
| 2 | FastAPI backend | `Day 02: Setup FastAPI backend` |
| 3 | React + TypeScript shell | `Day 03: Create React frontend shell` |
| 4 | Webcam capture | `Day 04: Add webcam capture interface` |
| 5 | WebSocket protocol | `Day 05: Define real-time WebSocket protocol` |
| 6 | Hand landmark extraction | `Day 06: Add hand landmark extraction` |
| 7 | Body pose extraction | `Day 07: Add body pose extraction` |
| 8 | Facial features | `Day 08: Add selected facial features` |
| 9 | Normalization | `Day 09: Implement landmark normalization` |
| 10 | Sequence buffer | `Day 10: Implement temporal sequence buffer` |
| 11 | Dataset loader | `Day 11: Add ISL dataset loader` |
| 12 | Video preprocessing | `Day 12: Build video preprocessing pipeline` |
| 13 | Standard sequence format | `Day 13: Standardize sequence dataset format` |
