# ⭐ Closing Vision

SignFlow AI is not simply an image classifier.

It is a complete AI engineering pipeline:

```text
Vision
  ↓
Structured Representation
  ↓
Temporal Learning
  ↓
Sequence Decoding
  ↓
Language Processing
  ↓
Real-Time Web System
  ↓
Accessible Output
```

The objective of the project is to demonstrate how modern computer vision, temporal deep learning, natural-language processing, and real-time web engineering can be combined to build an accessibility-focused AI application.
